INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I see. Hashaz has sent you? If that is the case, then perhaps you may be of use. I am Tide Mistress Rashal, and this is the Rethress Sanctum. Speak with my followers here and make yourself useful.', 0),
(40035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Many battles were fought for this. It is good to hear lives were not wasted for nothing. You are proving to be a good ally, interloper.', 0),
(40036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Spitelash Myrmidon are an abomination to the great depths. They deserved death for breaking our most sacred bonds. I am pleased.', 0),
(40037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Even just crippling their numbers is enough to please me. My kind would never stand for such an aberration of the tide\'s rules, and if I had the numbers, I would be sure to make them suffer.', 0),
(40038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Even just crippling their numbers is enough to please me. My kind would never stand for such an aberration of the tides rules, and if I had the numbers, I would be sure to make them suffer.', 0),
(40039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have found it... Well done, land-walker. There is still one final task I must ask of you to ensure the Rethress survive.', 0),
(40040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, someone new? We haven\'t had anyone new around here in a long time, and we haven\'t been told of someone new arriving. Do you want to help us out? You gotta prove to me you\'re the real deal, buddy!', 0),
(40041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wow, you got it? I guess you are the real deal, and you really do want to help us! I\'ll spread the word around that you\'re A-OKAY! Let us get some work done then!', 0),
(40042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, Gigno finally delivered the shipment? Well, I am pleased to receive it at all. I hadn\'t expected it would arrive in some time with all of the... trouble in the area.', 0),
(40043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Magus Bromley has news about the Analyzor 53G?! Hand that note over at once!$B$B<The gnome would swipe the letter and begin to read>.$B$BWhy, my Flaxwhisker!', 0),
(40044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Analyzor 53G was destroyed?... I will miss him dearly, but we shall create a better one in the future. Analyzor 54G will rise from the ashes like—I got carried away. Thanks for getting the Analyzation Chip. You \'ve saved us months of work!', 0),
(40045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Flight Log Book? Oh... I\'ve been so distracted that I haven\'t even thought about it for a while now! The last one that had it was... Dinkle Togpipe.', 0),
(40046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Dinkle? He\'s dead? Those blasted murlocs! I knew it would be trouble stationing him out there with only a rifle on that platform. Those higher-ups at Gnomeregan said the lights should be enough to scare off the creatures. Looks like they were wrong!', 0),
(40047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Flaxwhisker Front? They\'re still alive? I\'ll be honest, with all of the chaos in Gnomeregan, I had completely forgotten about the Flaxwhisker Front.', 0),
(40048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Gnomeregan… fallen? There are no more Tinkerspark Transponders?! We can\'t go back. There\'s no point in going back. Tinkertown sounds like nothing more than a ghetto compared to what Gnomeregan was! We will make Flaxwhisker Front into the new Gnomeregan. We just need time!', 0),
(40057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wow! You\'ve gotten it, you\'ve reclaimed our most valuable tool? I cannot thank you enough, outsider! We are forever in your debt, and now, the work can continue!', 0),
(40061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, it is done. It will take some time to bring all of the others into the fold, but I would not be a step closer without you. When I return to the great depths, I will have your name placed in honor. When we naga conquer the world, you will be spared to do as you please.$B$BTake this as a token of my gratitude, land-walker.', 0),
(40062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Dragons sure can be imposing. I under—... Wait, you actually got it? Wow, that\'s incredible! I\'m shocked you managed to do this. Thanks again. We\'ve needed this since we first came here.', 0),
(40063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, wow, you did it, great job! I sure hope those murlocs didn\'t give you much trouble. They sure can be nasty when you harm or scare them!', 0),
(40064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Splendid! So there really was one. The Gyronautical Compass will help a bunch around here. Thanks again for everything you\'ve done. As thanks, take this. We can do without it.', 0),
(40065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wonderous! Oh, by my name, you\'ve done a great job in getting this back! I was getting myself mentally prepared for having to work for another few months to restart everything.$B$BOh... My, it seems to have taken some damage...', 0),
(40066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'My my, look at that! You\'ve gotten everything I needed, and now I can get to work on putting this technology together for you!', 0),
(40067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That\'s it! I knew it would be on the second floor, now let\'s get started!', 0),
(40068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There, done! I appreciate all that you\'ve done. Honestly, you\'ve been a huge help to me around here. Without the Turbocharged Wobble-free Fizz Disk, I would be back in the Stone Age! Here, pick which one you like the most for all the trouble.', 0),
(40122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ahh, so Ansirem sent you. Good. I forwarded a letter to him quite a while ago, and it seems that this magical interference has grown ever more potent.', 0),
(40123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Splendid! Magnificent, in fact! I shall begin my testing at once.', 0),
(40124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It has been done? Have you dispelled the shrine? Let us see just how much of an effect this has had on our magics. Let us hope this is done once and for all.', 0),
(40125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Magus Bromley sent you? Well, it is good to hear from him. If he desires these shards to be examined, I will begin at once.', 0),
(40126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Magus Bromley begins to read the letter.>$B$BOh... Well, things have gotten a whole lot more complicated if this is the case.', 0),
(40127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is done? Truly?$B$BYou have my thanks hero. Your name shall go down in the annals of Dalaran history. A defender of magic is truly one that stands for virtue. Please, take one of these artifacts. It is the least I can offer. May it serve you well.', 0),
(40242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Why look at these beauties! These shells could certainly be used for all sorts of things, thanks again, no wonder Gigno saw good things in you!', 0),
(40243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I can breathe a sigh of relief. At one time I could walk the entirety of the beach, I could journey through the buried ruins of the old city, now submerged beneath the waves, but now, I am confined to this very tower. Perhaps one day I will be free to journey again.', 0),
(40244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Eldara Relay-Orb is one of its kind, and incredibly rare, without this my ability to study, and communicate with the last Keeper\'s of Azshara were both tampered. I cannot thank you enough for finding it.', 0),
(40245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'After many long years, it is returned. This Harmonization Gem was worthless within the hands of those naga, for they deal with magic they will never understand. You have done a great favor for us Keepers.', 0),
(40246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good work in finding one, I was beginning to have my doubts. The power the Satyr wield in such a rod is but a fraction of the power we used to have in our glory. The Ley-lines flowed with a power unimaginable, it was so strong that even now, after so much time has past, the energy still lingers.$B$BAs dampened as it is now, it still holds power we must preserve, and keep secret.', 0),
(40247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Another chapter begins, the Keepers of Azshara may not fade into memory this early.', 0),
(40252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I have heard faded messages of someone helping Keeper Iselus, and now I have you before me. The Eldarath Harmonization Gem has been recovered then, good to hear.', 0),
(40253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I can feel the energy flowing once again, it will no doubt attract the attention of outside forces, or perhaps those who wish to uncover the secrets of Azshara for themselves. Our next step will be a crucial one, and will be required to keep the mysteries of this land from being uncovered.', 0),
(40254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Us Keepers could not fulfill the lengths of our duties, and I imagine we will not last forever, one day the Tower of Eldara will lose its master, and perhaps one day I may fall as well. I know not what has happened to the others, though I still hope they are alive and well.$B$BIf we are to fulfill atleast one of our duties, then we shall dispell much of the great magics buried beneath the waves, under the sands. The last thing we intended was for something much more foul to untangle the web of secrets we created.$B$BI must thank you again $N, for everything you have done, you have assisted us in a time of great need, and perhaps now we may last many more years, especially with the energy of the Ley-Lines flowing, and old secrets dispelled. Me and Keeper Iselus have only you to thank, without you, we would have been aimless in our goals.', 0),
(40283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good. They will fear us.', 0),
(40284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ha! I knew you had it! You are a strong $C, very strong. It reminds me of my youth, cutting down hordes of enemies!', 0),
(40285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'He met with my friend? I know I should be cautious to heed the words of a stranger, but I trust him.$B$BIf he says the last place he remembers seeing him was at the Temple of Arkkoran, then that must be it.', 0),
(40286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It\'s broken...', 0),
(40287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You found it. This Blade will be whole again, mark my words $N.', 0),
(40288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Katokar Bladewind would take his time studying the fel energy before a sigh of relief would escape him>.$B$BThis should be enough, you\'ve done well.', 0),
(40289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is done then, and with that, he shall walk freely with those he regarded as heroes. He shall be buried with his blade, I can guarentee that, you have put my mind, and my heart at rest $N. Take my Binding as thanks for the work I could not do.$B$BIt is not often that someone comes and offers to aid in such a manner, your spirit is truly that of great heroes, bear my Binding with pride, and honor.', 0),
(40290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is some good game, $C. But I have more to ask from you.', 0),
(40291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You impress me. It\'s not easy to impress old Nulda. Ill make sure to put the claws to good use, hope to see you around.', 0),
(40292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Yes, this is all I need. Now, let me prepare the ritual.', 0),
(40293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The vision gave us more questions than answers. The city must\'ve been Zin-Azshari, the dying peoples must\'ve been Highborne of the old. The wave represented the Sundering. It was a warning. A warning, that all of this can happen again.', 0),
(40294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A dragon, you say? Well, me and my friend there, Brutan, noticed something weird happening in these forests, which could be explained by the presence of the Dragonflight.', 0),
(40295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'How many? This is worse than we expected.', 0),
(40296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thank you, young one. Talom did well, advising you to come to me.', 0),
(40297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The elements are calmed, for now. Thank you, $C. Your help will never be forgotten. We owe you much.', 0),
(41313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Those appear positively unnatural. Ley line crystals materialize themselves on rare occasions when fleeting ley essence seeps through the earth, but these... Their formation appears different, almost forced, in a sense. Hm, peculiar...$B$B<Archmage Xylem ponders for a bit, while inspecting the crystals further. Suddenly an epiphany strikes him.>$B$B$N, there are many plausible explanations for this. But to confirm my own theory, I need to conduct some tests first. Will you assist me?', 0),
(41314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Regrettable, and concerning. I have to be even more selective in my choice of apprentices in the future. It is baffling that Tharessa acted so recklessly, I did not expect such behaviour from her. Granted, her eagerness was apparent, yet I assumed and hoped it to be rooted in her pursuit of knowledge, not power. Whoever she worked for, I will see to it they will be brought to justice for their actions.$B$BNonetheless, with the focus orb back in my possession, we will finally get to the bottom of this leyline conundrum.', 0),
(41315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Positively outstanding. What we\'ve witnessed proved my suspicions correct: the ley line crystals function as a conduit of energy that, when exposed to concentrated amounts of magic, manifest themselves in arcane monstrosities. If you take a closer look, both crystal remains are identical, meaning the blood elves have altered their own crystal after obtaining it from the Blue Dragonflight - whether they got it by force or cooperation, I am unsure to answer.$B$BThanks to you, my understanding of this land and its inhabitants heightened again. It is concerning, however, to know the Blue Dragonflight is undertaking such suspicious actions. They rarely care for the affairs of mortals, but do not hesitate to halt the abuse of Azeroth\'s magic in an instant. Let us observe and hope for the best outcome for now.$B$BAs for your reward; you are a capable jewelcrafter, correct? Let me show you how to fashion a staff that amplifies the wielder\'s magical abilities, then.', 0),
(41320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'As you can see, what I have witnessed paints a grim picture for my brethren at the Harborage. I have led them to this world in search for safety, and now our past threatens to haunt us once more. I need to prevent this, yet alone I am unable to. Dear stranger, will you assist me like you assisted Sanv K\'la?', 0),
(41321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Akh Z\'ador takes the slimy, bloody brains and chomps them piece by piece. It is revolting to look at.>$B$BHm, a bit on the spongy side, but not disgusting. I\'ve had worse, trust me. Thank you, $N, I can feel the mental weakness fading already.', 0),
(41322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Zesty and spicy - a combination typical for draenei cuisine. Thank you for providing me with enough food to regain my vitality. Your kindness goes a long way, and I wish I could repay you with a traditional meal of my people, one prepared with ingredients from Draenor. But I digress, sentimentalities are of no use here.', 0),
(41323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'My cane! I\'ve only seen it this disheveled after we escaped Draenor years ago. Eternal gratitude to you, $N. And this… mojo, you call it? This swirling energy is completely foreign to me. Your world will probably never cease to bewilder me.$B$B<Akh Z\'ador hits his chest with his fist in respect for your deeds.>', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40034, 0, 0, 'Yes? What could it be that you want from me, $R?', 0),
(40035, 0, 0, 'Have you collected what I asked for?', 0),
(40036, 0, 0, 'Have you killed the oathbreakers, $R?', 0),
(40037, 0, 0, 'Have the servants been dealt with, $R?', 0),
(40038, 0, 0, 'Have you got his head, interloper?', 0),
(40039, 0, 0, 'Have you found the Scepter? Can you even follow instructions, $R?', 0),
(40040, 0, 0, 'Mmm, yes?', 0),
(40041, 0, 0, 'Have you gotten the Horn for me?', 0),
(40042, 0, 0, 'Hello there, traveler. Do you bring news from the outside world?', 0),
(40043, 0, 0, 'You\'re back. Splendid. Did he appreciate the supplies?', 0),
(40044, 0, 0, 'Have you got the Analyzation Chip? You must recover it!', 0),
(40045, 0, 0, 'Hello there. How can I help you, $R?', 0),
(40046, 0, 0, 'Have you gotten the Flight Logbook? It’s certainly taking a while!', 0),
(40047, 0, 0, 'Is there something I can help you with?', 0),
(40048, 0, 0, 'So, is Gnomeregan sending help?', 0),
(40057, 0, 0, 'Have you done it? Have you recovered the Transponder?', 0),
(40061, 0, 0, 'Have you killed him? Have you stopped this insurrection?', 0),
(40062, 0, 0, 'So, have you tackled the Dragonflight yet?', 0),
(40063, 0, 0, 'We need those Sprugbolts! They are an intricate part that we cannot just make.', 0),
(40064, 0, 0, 'Have you found the boat?', 0),
(40065, 0, 0, 'Have you found our old work site? Did you reclaim the Turbocharged Wobble-free Fizz Disk?!', 0),
(40066, 0, 0, 'I know it\'s quite the list. Still, the quicker you get the items to me, the quicker I can get started!', 0),
(40067, 0, 0, 'Any luck? I\'m still looking around, but I can\'t find it.', 0),
(40068, 0, 0, 'I\'m working on it, not now.', 0),
(40122, 0, 0, 'Hello, $R. It is good to see a friendly face in such a worn landscape.', 0),
(40123, 0, 0, 'Have you gathered the Ley-shards yet?', 0),
(40124, 0, 0, 'Have the Naga been dealt with?', 0),
(40125, 0, 0, 'What brings you to Dalaran?', 0),
(40126, 0, 0, 'So, you return. What did Ansirem say about the Ley-shards?', 0),
(40127, 0, 0, 'Have you ended the dampening that lies upon Azshara?', 0),
(40242, 0, 0, 'We need more methods to shield our projects, have you had any luck?', 0),
(40243, 0, 0, 'Have the invasive species been dealt with?', 0),
(40244, 0, 0, 'Have you recovered my valueable items?', 0),
(40245, 0, 0, 'When the Gem is returned, then we can begin construction of a staff.', 0),
(40246, 0, 0, 'Walk with caution, the Satyr are lackies of a much greater power.', 0),
(40247, 0, 0, 'I must concentrate.', 0),
(40252, 0, 0, 'Can I help you?', 0),
(40253, 0, 0, 'When you have spoken the phrase the magic that once held the stone and made it dormant will be inactive. This spell was placed long ago to deter any outside entities from interfering, if we can act quickly, I will be able to do as I need.', 0),
(40254, 0, 0, 'The energy used in Dire Maul is truly fascinating, I can feel it from all the way here. I believe this will be our only chance of fulfilling our oath as Keepers.', 0),
(40283, 0, 0, 'Bloodfist Point is at danger as long as the Naga slither and the Banshees wail in those forests.', 0),
(40284, 0, 0, 'The Legash Encampment is close to our base. I will be able to see you fighting, so don\'t disappoint me. I want some fun.', 0),
(40285, 0, 0, 'I will find his Blade.', 0),
(40286, 0, 0, 'I will find his Blade.', 0),
(40287, 0, 0, 'There is only sorrow to be found within Azshara.', 0),
(40288, 0, 0, 'The Fortress of Jaedenar is the most powerful bastion of the Legion in Felwood, strike them down.', 0),
(40289, 0, 0, 'This is important to me $N.', 0),
(40290, 0, 0, 'Got the meat? No? Then get moving.', 0),
(40291, 0, 0, 'Scared already?', 0),
(40292, 0, 0, 'Have you found the ingredients yet?', 0),
(40293, 0, 0, 'The ritual must not be disturbed.', 0),
(40294, 0, 0, 'Waste no time.', 0),
(40295, 0, 0, 'Have you been to Lake Mennar yet? It\'s in the southern part of Azshara.', 0),
(40296, 0, 0, 'Blue Dragonflight in such numbers. This is really worrying.', 0),
(40297, 0, 0, 'So, have you done it?', 0),
(41313, 0, 0, 'Lake Mennar is a focal point of arcane energy, it is not puzzling to see why the Blue Dragonflight congregates at that location. What exactly the blood elves are doing here eludes me, however.', 0),
(41314, 0, 0, 'Have you had any luck in recovering what I seek?', 0),
(41315, 0, 0, 'The focus orb will ensure the magical energies do not overload the crystals. So do not fear they might explode violently in your immediate vicinity.', 0),
(41320, 0, 0, 'Please, I insist: sit down and make yourself comfortable.', 0),
(41321, 0, 0, 'It has been a long time since I\'ve tasted brains.', 0),
(41322, 0, 0, 'Despite knowing many of my people\'s recipes, I am not a good cook. You can ask anyone in the Harborage, even Noburo was considered a better cook than me!', 0),
(41323, 0, 0, 'I am not naive to think our escape to Azeroth would shield us from every evil there is, yet I cannot feel disheartened by the fact a breeding ground of depravity would have its heart right at the center of our new home.', 0);
